<title>BELGIUM: MORE O'FERRALL WINS BELGIAN PHONE BOX DEAL.</title>
<headline>MORE O'FERRALL WINS BELGIAN PHONE BOX DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian telephone company Belgacom SA said on Tuesday it had granted poster site company More O'Ferrall a concession for advertising boards in a new generation of phone boxes.</p>
<p>In a statement, Belgacom said it planned to install 400 of the phone boxes in 1996 and more in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;Belgacom and More O Ferrall gradually foresee the installation of a national network of 2,000 advertising modules, beginning in 1997, with the initial focus on the centres of the five largest cities,&quot; Belgacom said.</p>
<p>Financial details were not given.</p>
